#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:135
msgid ""
"Chromatic aberration is easily recognized as color fringes towards the image "
"corners. CA is due to a varying lens focus for different colors."
msgstr ""
"Klöörafwieken lett sik eenfach kennen, dat gifft Klöörränners na't Bild sien "
"Huken hen. De Lins hett denn verscheden Brennwieden för de Klören."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:138
msgid "Vignetting"
msgstr "Randschadden"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:139
msgid ""
"Vignetting refers to an image darkening, mostly in the corners. Optical and "
"natural vignetting can be canceled out with this option, whereas mechanical "
"vignetting will not be cured."
msgstr ""
"Randschadden bedüüdt, dat Bild warrt tomehrst na de Huken hen düüsterer. "
"Optisch un natüürlich Randschaddens laat sik mit disse Funkschoon wegmaken, "
"mechaansche nich."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:142
msgid "Color Correction"
msgstr "Klöörrichten"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:143
msgid ""
"All lenses have a slight color tinge to them, mostly due to the anti-"
"reflective coating. The tinge can be canceled when the respective data is "
"known for the lens."
msgstr ""
"All Linsen hebbt en Klöörfehler, in de Hööftsaak kummt dat vun de Antireflex-"
"Laag. Disse Fehler lett sik richten, wenn Du de tohören Daten vun de Lins "
"kennen deist."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:146
msgid "Distortion"
msgstr "Vertarren"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:147
msgid ""
"Distortion refers to an image deformation, which is most pronounced towards "
"the corners. These Seidel aberrations are known as pincushion and barrel "
"distortions."
msgstr ""
"Vertarren is en leeg Weddergaav vun de Formen op't Bild un warrt na de Huken "
"hen stärker. Disse Afbildfehlers sünd as »Küssen-« un »Tünnvertarren« begäng."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:150
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "Geometrie"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:151
msgid ""
"Four geometries are handled here: Rectilinear (99 percent of all lenses), "
"Fisheye, Cylindrical, Equirectangular."
msgstr ""
"Hier sünd veer Buuformen mööglich: Liekut (99% Perzent vun all Linsen), "
"Fischoog, Zylinnersch un Längdenliek Zylinnersch."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:115
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:345
msgid "Lens Distortion"
msgstr "Linsvertarren"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:130
msgid ""
"You can see here a thumbnail preview of the distortion correction applied to "
"a cross pattern."
msgstr ""
"Dit is en Lüttbild-Vöransicht vun de Vertarren-Korrektuur, anwendt op en "
"Gadder."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:135
msgctxt "value for amount of distortion"
msgid "Main:"
msgstr "Hööft:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:141
msgid ""
"This value controls the amount of distortion. Negative values correct lens "
"barrel distortion, while positive values correct lens pincushion distortion."
msgstr ""
"Disse Weert stüert de Vertarrenstärk. Negative Weerten richt Tünn-Vertarren, "
"un positive Weerten Küssen-Vertarren."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:147
msgid "Edge:"
msgstr "Kant:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:153
msgid ""
"This value controls in the same manner as the Main control, but has more "
"effect at the edges of the image than at the center."
msgstr ""
"Disse Weert stüert dat sülve Bedregen as de allgemeen Kuntrull, man hett "
"mehr Effekt op de Bildkanten as op de Merrn."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:158
msgid "Zoom:"
msgstr "Ansichtgrött:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:164
msgid "This value rescales the overall image size."
msgstr "Disse Weert passt de Bildgrött nieg to."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:168
msgid "Brighten:"
msgstr "Ophellen:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:174
msgid "This value adjusts the brightness in image corners."
msgstr "Disse Weert passt de Helligkeit in de Bildecken to."

