#: imageplugins/coreplugin/ratiocrop/ratiocroptool.cpp:208
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/ratiocrop/ratiocroptool.cpp:969
msgid "Aspect Ratio Crop"
msgstr "Proportschonaal Tosnieden"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/ratiocrop/ratiocroptool.cpp:216
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can see the aspect ratio selection preview used for cropping. "
"You can use the mouse to move and resize the crop area.</p><p>Press and hold "
"the <b>CTRL</b> key to move the opposite corner too.</p><p>Press and hold "
"the <b>SHIFT</b> key to move the closest corner to the mouse pointer.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Dit is de Utsöökvöransicht för't Tosnieden na Proportschoon. Dat "
"Tosniedrebeet lett sik mit de Muus in de Grött ännern un bewegen.</p><p>Holl "
"de <b>Strg</b>-Tast daal, wenn Du ok de Höörn  op de Güntsiet bewegen wullt."
"</p><p>Mit de <b>Ümschalt</b>-Tast kannst Du de neegste Höörn na den "
"Muuswieser bewegen.</p>"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/ratiocrop/ratiocroptool.cpp:241
msgid "Max. Aspect"
msgstr "Gröttst Proportschoon"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/ratiocrop/ratiocroptool.cpp:242
msgid "Set selection area to the maximum size according to the current ratio."
msgstr "Utsöökrebeet op Hööchstgrött för de aktuelle Proportschoon fastleggen."

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/ratiocrop/ratiocroptool.cpp:252
msgid "Aspect ratio:"
msgstr "Bildproportschoon:"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/ratiocrop/ratiocroptool.cpp:254
msgctxt "custom aspect ratio crop settings"
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Egen"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/ratiocrop/ratiocroptool.cpp:261
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/ratiocrop/ratiocroptool.cpp:741
msgid "Golden Ratio"
msgstr "Gollen Snitt"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/ratiocrop/ratiocroptool.cpp:262
msgctxt "no crop mode"
msgid "None"
msgstr "Keen"

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/ratiocrop/ratiocroptool.cpp:265
msgid ""
"<p>Select your constrained aspect ratio for cropping. Aspect Ratio Crop tool "
"uses a relative ratio. That means it is the same if you use centimeters or "
"inches and it does not specify the physical size.</p><p>You can see below a "
"correspondence list of traditional photographic paper sizes and aspect ratio "
"crop:</p><p><b>2:3</b>: 10x15cm, 20x30cm, 30x45cm, 4x6\", 8x12\", 12x18\", "
"16x24\", 20x30\"</p><p><b>3:4</b>: 6x8cm, 15x20cm, 18x24cm, 30x40cm, 3.75x5"
"\", 4.5x6\", 6x8\", 7.5x10\", 9x12\"</p><p><b>4:5</b>: 20x25cm, 40x50cm, 8x10"
"\", 16x20\"</p><p><b>5:7</b>: 15x21cm, 30x42cm, 5x7\"</p><p><b>7:10</b>: "
"21x30cm, 42x60cm, 3.5x5\"</p><p>The <b>Golden Ratio</b> is 1:1.618. A "
"composition following this rule is considered visually harmonious but can be "
"unadapted to print on standard photographic paper.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Söök hier Dien Bildproportschoon för't Tosnieden ut. Dit Warktüüch bruukt "
"relative Proportschonen, wat bedüüdt, dat bloots de Proportschonen vun de "
"Bildkanten angeven warrt, nich ehr Längden.</p><p>De List nerrn gifft "
"normaal Formaten vun Fotopapeer un ehr Bildkantenproportschoon an:</"
"p><p><b>2:3</b>: 10x15cm, 20x30cm, 30x45cm, 4x6\", 8x12\", 12x18\", 16x24\", "
"20x30\"</p><p><b>3:4</b>: 6x8cm, 15x20cm, 18x24cm, 30x40cm, 3,75x5\", 4,5x6"
"\", 6x8\", 7,5x10\", 9x12\"</p><p><b>4:5</b>: 20x25cm, 40x50cm, 8x10\", 16x20"
"\"</p><p><b>5:7</b>: 15x21cm, 30x42cm, 5x7\"</p><p><b>7:10</b>: 21x30cm, "
"42x60cm, 3,5x5\"</p><p>De <b>Gollen Snitt</b> liggt bi 1:1,618. Disse "
"Proportschoon warrt vun de mehrsten Lüüd as harmoonsch estemeert, man lett "
"sik nich goot op Standard-Fotopapeer drucken.</p>"

